1
00:00:00,856 --> 00:00:04,106
(Howard:)...and you can pon farr
Amy Farrah Fowler later.

2
00:00:04,735 --> 00:00:07,655
(Sheldon:)-I don't drink coffee.
-All right, you can have a hot chocolate.

3
00:00:07,822 --> 00:00:11,612
(Sheldon:)As I will not be engaging in this nonsense,
my choice of beverage is moot.

4
00:00:11,784 --> 00:00:13,824
(Sheldon:)For the record,
I only drink hot chocolate...

5
00:00:13,995 --> 00:00:16,125
(Sheldon:)...in months with an R in them.

6
00:00:17,123 --> 00:00:20,213
(Leonard:)-Why?
-What's life without whimsy?

7
00:00:23,129 --> 00:00:24,299
(Howard:)Okay, I'm out.

8
00:00:30,136 --> 00:00:31,926
(Leonard:)Sheldon...

9
00:00:32,096 --> 00:00:35,556
(Raj:)...I've hidden the dirty sock from the roof
somewhere in your apartment.

10
00:00:37,977 --> 00:00:40,057
Unless you're willing
to come with us to meet this girl...

11
00:00:40,229 --> 00:00:43,399
(Raj:)...it will remain there forever.

12
00:00:44,984 --> 00:00:46,024
(Sheldon:)You're bluffing.

13
00:00:47,111 --> 00:00:49,071
(Raj:)Are you willing to risk it?

14
00:00:50,740 --> 00:01:11,030
(Sheldon:)Curse you.

